[00:12.57]1. God has commanded us this day;
[00:16.57]He has given us a charge to obey.
[00:22.94]At all times, be ready to impart
[00:28.78]The reason for the hope within your heart.
[00:31.26](Chorus)
[00:33.74]So preach the word
[00:36.94]So that ev’ryone can hear!
[00:39.90]Preach the word,
[00:41.04]For we know the end is near.
[00:45.74]Preach the word,
[00:47.74]Help the meek to understand.
[00:51.24]Preach the word
[00:53.24]Throughout the land!
[01:06.62]2. Seasons of trouble we will face;
[01:11.74]Opposition may bring shame and disgrace.
[01:17.82]Though preaching may out of season seem,
[01:23.13]Our trust is in our God, who is supreme.
[01:25.63](Chorus)
[01:28.13]So preach the word
[01:31.13]So that ev’ryone can hear!
[01:34.13]Preach the word,
[01:37.13]For we know the end is near.
[01:40.13]Preach the word,
[01:43.48]Help the meek to understand.
[01:46.48]Preach the word
[02:00.48]Throughout the land!
[02:04.48]3. Seasons of favor we will see,
[02:08.48]And the need for us to teach, there will be.
[02:12.48]The way to salvation we proclaim
[02:19.00]And help to sanctify Jehovah’s name.
[02:21.00](Chorus)
[02:23.00]So preach the word
[02:26.00]So that ev’ryone can hear!
[02:29.00]Preach the word,
[02:32.00]For we know the end is near.
[02:35.00]Preach the word,
[02:38.00]Help the meek to understand.
[02:40.50]Preach the word
[02:43.00]Throughout the land!